     "titulo": "Analytical reading of after-sales directives",
     "texto": [
      "In complex commercial conditions the discursive order follows a strict pragmatic pattern: temporal delimitation of the claim, evidentiary documentary requirement (**Voraussetzung ist, dass der Kassenbon vorliegt**), prohibitive exclusion clauses (**ausgeschlossen**) and deadlines for processing the file (**Bearbeitungszeit**)."
